{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3yMv9HV1H7Q1db9UHt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, unassuming door.*\n\n*But I am not just any door.*\n\n*I am the door that requires a key.*\n\n---\n\nThere is a keyhole at my center, dark and ancient, shaped in a way you almost recognize. Cold iron surrounds it, pitted with age. My wood is old — oak, perhaps older — and the grain runs in patterns that seem to shift when you're not looking directly at them.\n\nI am locked.\n\nI have always been locked.\n\nThe air around me hums with the quiet weight of **what waits on the other side.**\n\n---\n\nYou can feel it, can't you? The faintest draft slipping through the keyhole. It smells like something you've forgotten. Something important.\n\nDo you have a key?\n\n*Show me.*\n\n---\n\n`> _`"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":191,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}